      "id": "community/emoji/twemoji/color",
      "name": "Twemoji Color",
      "description": "The complete Twemoji 17.0.3 emoji set: all 3,953 canonical Unicode 17 glyphs, flags and skin tones included, as one bundle file. Choosing a set is what stops a canvas or an export drawing the operating system's own emoji, so the same text looks the same on every device and in every exported file. The bundle carries the exact pack manifest plus each glyph's untouched source SVG, it is fetched only when a set is chosen, and an export that places one records the set's licence as a Content Credentials source.",
