      "description": "The OpenMoji 17.0.0 colour set as one bundle file: 4,315 glyphs, which is 3,949 of the 3,953 canonical Unicode 17 keys plus 366 of the project's own symbols. Its licence is CC BY-SA 4.0, so the credit travels with every export and a recoloured glyph is an adaptation: share one and the export panel asks for a compatible licence. Four Unicode glyphs and one symbol are absent because their upstream files carry defects the renderer refuses, and meta.emoji.missing names each one with its reason.",
